<title>USA: U.S. debt futures start slightly higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. debt futures start slightly higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 1 - U.S. debt futures opened slightly higher after steep gains on Wednesday. Traders await Mar personal income and consumption and the latest weekly jobless claims at 0730 CDT/1230 GMT. Income forecast up 0.4 pct, consumption seen up 0.5 pct, and claims expected at 325,000.</p>
